Rh1bnf1 vreff h1n 1253.18954325804
Vh1p h1p 0 DC 0
Vh1n h1n 0 DC 0
* matched subtractor h1: I = i(Vh1p) - i(Vh1n)
Bh1sub 0 h1d I = i(Vh1p) - i(Vh1n)
* ratiometric I-to-V: V = I * R_IV,  R_IV=33333.3333333333 (weight ~ R_IV / R_w)
Rh1iv h1d 0 33333.3333333333
Eh1sc h1raw 0 h1d 0 1
Eh1lin h1lin 0 h1raw 0 1
* direct bounded ReLU: y=max(0, min(15, v(h1lin))) no high-gain op-amp loop
Bh1relu h1y 0 V = max(0, min(15, v(h1lin)))
Eh1 h1buf 0 h1y 0 1

